menu "Cogitador M-01 Gemini Direct"

    config COGITADOR_GEMINI_MODEL
        string "Primary Gemini Live model"
        default "gemini-3.1-flash-live-preview"
        help
            Model used for new conversations. A provisioned override
            (RPC set_model) takes precedence without recompiling.
            gemini-3.8-live accepted setup but never transcribed or answered
            over a raw WebSocket in the 2026-11-24 hardware tests.

    config COGITADOR_GEMINI_FALLBACK_MODEL
        string "Fallback Gemini Live model"
        default "gemini-3.8-live"
        help
            Used after repeated setup failures, or once per boot when the
            active model stays silent while the user speaks.

    config COGITADOR_SILENT_MODEL_VOICED_FRAMES
        int "Voiced 40 ms frames without transcription before swapping model"
        range 25 1000
        default 250
        help
            Watchdog for a model that completes setup but never answers: after
            this many loud uplink frames (default 10 s of speech) with no input
            transcription on the connection, reconnect with the other model.

    config COGITADOR_VOICED_PEAK_THRESHOLD
        int "Uplink frame peak counted as voiced (0..32767)"
        range 100 32767
        default 1036
        help
            1036 is about -30 dBFS; the room noise floor measured about -42 dBFS.

    config COGITADOR_GEMINI_VOICE
        string "Prebuilt voice"
        default "Charon"

    config COGITADOR_GEMINI_LANGUAGE
        string "Speech language (BCP-47)"
        default "es-ES"

    config COGITADOR_WAKE_WORD
        bool "Wake on \"Hola ESP\" (local WakeNet10, wn10_es_holaesp)"
        default y
        help
            Listen locally for "Hola ESP" while the conversation is closed. No
            WebSocket is open and no audio leaves the device while idle. Needs the
            "model" partition with the esp-sr model image; without it Cogitador keeps
            working with touch only.

    config COGITADOR_ROLE_PHONE_PAGE
        bool "Phone page for private secrets in role mode"
        default y
        help
            While role mode is on, a small web page on port 80 of the home
            Wi-Fi lets each player register by name and read only their own
            secrets. Without it, secrets use the on-screen card.

    config COGITADOR_ROLE_IDLE_TIMEOUT_S
        int "Seconds without activity before returning to idle in role mode"
        range 30 900
        default 180
        help
            Role-play players think, roll and talk among themselves: the
            conversation waits longer before closing while modo_rol is on.

    config COGITADOR_IDLE_TIMEOUT_S
        int "Seconds without activity before returning to idle"
        range 10 600
        default 15
        help
            While listening, close the conversation after this time with no local
            voice (uplink frames above COGITADOR_VOICED_PEAK_THRESHOLD), user
            transcription, model output, turn or tap. Counted from the end of
            Cogitador's speech. Suspended while a reply is pending (see
            COGITADOR_RESPONSE_TIMEOUT_S).

    config COGITADOR_GOOGLE_SEARCH
        bool "Grounding with Google Search (native Live API tool)"
        default n
        help
            Optional, OFF by default (owner's decision, 2026-11-25): in test 10
            every setup declaring googleSearch was closed with code 1011 because
            the free-tier quota was exceeded on both models, and Cogitador could not
            connect. Enable only with quota available.

            Declare the googleSearch tool in the Live setup message so Gemini can
            search the web by itself (server side, no intermediate service). Each
            search may be billed separately: see docs/GOOGLE_SEARCH.md.

    config COGITADOR_SHOW_SEARCH_SOURCES
        bool "Show Google search suggestions and sources on the status line"
        depends on COGITADOR_GOOGLE_SEARCH
        default n
        help
            Off by default at the owner's request: Cogitador searches quietly and never
            cites sources. When on, the status line rotates "GOOGLE: <query>" and
            "FUENTE n/m: <domain>" (see docs/GOOGLE_SEARCH.md section 4).

    config COGITADOR_RESPONSE_TIMEOUT_S
        int "Seconds to wait for Gemini to finish a turn (search, thinking)"
        range 10 120
        default 30
        help
            After the user's turn, and while the model's turn is open (no
            turnComplete yet), the idle timeout is suspended and the eye stays
            amber until this many seconds pass without any server output.
            Protects searches and reasoning pauses from the idle return.

    config COGITADOR_PREROLL_MS
        int "Audio kept after the wake word while connecting (ms)"
        range 400 4000
        default 2000
        help
            Frames captured between "Hola ESP" and setupComplete are sent first so
            the question spoken right after the wake word is not lost.

    config COGITADOR_SPEAKER_VOLUME
        int "Speaker volume (0-100)"
        range 1 100
        default 70

    config COGITADOR_MIC_GAIN_DB
        int "Microphone gain (dB)"
        range 0 42
        default 24
        help
            30 dB saturated (0 dBFS peaks) with normal speech at 20-30 cm and
            with speaker echo in the first hardware tests.

endmenu
